  "excluded_entries": [],
  "limitations": [
    "R1 substitutes a hanging sync with a killable process in Docker isolation. A real stalled sync can stay in uninterruptible kernel state, which the bounded reap abandons rather than terminates.",
    "R3 observes the atomic rename through a substituted mv and does not prove filesystem rename atomicity.",
    "Durability under power loss, upload acknowledgment, and the guardian and crash-monitor bounds are not verified.",
    "No native service manager, real Docker daemon, or disposable runner executed this cycle.",
    "Producer failure is verified separately by the record-producer cycle. Creation fencing, private Docker containment, reserve bounds, hosted enforcement, ratification, and acceptance remain pending."
  ]
}
